  "description": "纯代码做一集东方 Project 科普视频的模板 / Touhou, drawn in code: a template for a voiced Touhou fan explainer video in pure JavaScript + Canvas 2D (14 procedural paper-cut characters, AquesTalk voice, music-box BGM, MP4 renderer; no image assets, no AI art)",
